{"framework":"vue","displayName":"Formulas ▸ Formula calculation · Render HYPERLINK formulas as links · Vue 3","tier":2,"engine":"container","sandpackTemplate":null,"sandpackEnvironment":null,"container":"vue","htWrappers":["@handsontable/vue3"],"entry":"/src/main.ts","htmlEntry":"/index.html","devCommand":"pnpm exec vite --host 0.0.0.0 --port 5173","buildCommand":"vite build","outputDir":"dist","outputGlob":null,"staticExport":false,"spaMode":false,"port":5173,"installCommand":"pnpm install","htCoreRange":"0.0.0-next-7801196-20261016","fileCount":5,"assets":[],"skipped":[],"files":{"/package.json":"{\n  \"name\": \"handsontable-vue-example\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"packageManager\": \"pnpm@10.34.5\",\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"handsontable\": \"0.0.0-next-7801196-20261016\",\n    \"@handsontable/vue3\": \"0.0.0-next-7801196-20261016\",\n    \"vue\": \"3.x\",\n    \"vite\": \"^5.4.0\",\n    \"@vitejs/plugin-vue\": \"^5.0.0\",\n    \"hyperformula\": \"3.5.0\"\n  },\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"start\": \"vite\",\n    \"build\": \"vite build\"\n  }\n}","/vite.config.js":"import { defineConfig } from \"vite\";\nimport vue from \"@vitejs/plugin-vue\";\n\nexport default defineConfig({ plugins: [vue()], server: { allowedHosts: true } });","/index.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>Handsontable Vue Example</title>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div id=\"example-hyperlinks\"></div>\n  <script type=\"module\" src=\"/src/main.ts\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>","/src/main.ts":"import { createApp } from \"vue\";\nimport App from \"./App.vue\";\ncreateApp(App).mount(\"#example-hyperlinks\");","/src/App.vue":"<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { ref, markRaw } from 'vue';\nimport { HotTable } from '@handsontable/vue3';\nimport { registerAllModules } from 'handsontable/registry';\nimport { HyperFormula } from 'hyperformula';\nimport type { GridSettings } from 'handsontable/settings';\n\n// register Handsontable's modules\nregisterAllModules();\n\nconst data: string[][] = [\n  ['Acme Corp', '=HYPERLINK(\"https://example.com/acme\", \"acme.example.com\")'],\n  ['Vertex Industries', '=HYPERLINK(\"https://example.com/vertex\", \"vertex.example.com\")'],\n  ['Harbor Goods', '=HYPERLINK(\"https://example.com/harbor\", \"harbor.example.com\")'],\n  ['Alpine Supply Co.', '=HYPERLINK(\"https://example.com/alpine\", \"alpine.example.com\")'],\n  ['Summit Logistics', '=HYPERLINK(\"https://example.com/summit\", \"summit.example.com\")'],\n];\n\nconst hotSettings = ref<GridSettings>({\n  data,\n  colHeaders: ['Company', 'Website'],\n  rowHeaders: true,\n  height: 'auto',\n  colWidths: [180, 220],\n  formulas: { engine: markRaw(HyperFormula), hyperlinks: true },\n  autoWrapRow: true,\n  autoWrapCol: true,\n  licenseKey: 'non-commercial-and-evaluation',\n});\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div id=\"example-hyperlinks\">\n    <HotTable :settings=\"hotSettings\" />\n  </div>\n</template>"},"docsPath":"guides/formulas/formula-calculation/vue/example-hyperlinks.vue","breadcrumb":["Formulas","Formula calculation"],"guide":"guides/formulas/formula-calculation/formula-calculation.md","guideTitle":"Formula calculation","exampleId":"example-hyperlinks","exampleTitle":"Render HYPERLINK formulas as links","docPermalink":"/formula-calculation","lang":"Vue 3"}
